# set_entity_data body for a summoned minecraft:slime (NBT Size:1b),
# captured from a vanilla 26.1.2 dedicated server.
#
# Provenance: tools/chat-capture/chicken_experiment.py, session
# target/chicken-capture/bodies/055995_s2c_play_99.bin (one client in the
# world; the summon ran through the server console at the player).
#
# fc 08              entity id 1148 (VarInt)
# 09 03              index 9, serializer 3 (float)
# 40 80 00 00        4.0 — the slime's max health, big-endian IEEE 754
# 10 01              index 16, serializer 1 (VarInt)
# 02                 the slime's size slot: NBT Size 1 sends 2, i.e. Size + 1
# ff                 terminator
fc 08 09 03 40 80 00 00 10 01 02 ff
